  "details": "Description\n\nEvery time i try to join a game it automatically teleports me back into my homeworld. It literally happened out of nowhere even though i already was able to join 2 games before that. I cant join a game regularly, i cant join a game through a portal, and i cant join a game through a friend’s invite. Im on mobile btw this has never happened before either\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nJust by joining a game!! I tried to join through a portal and tried to join through my friend and neither worked.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: World\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: iOSMobile (platform: iOS - Mobile, store: TestFlight, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: IPhonePlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.20201\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-09-29_14-20-46.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_77695371-b017-490c-ab66-a853eb510ce5/1/file)",
